      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Techniques in Prayer Therapy&quot; by Joseph Murphy, the author of &quot;The Power of Your Subconscious Mind,&quot; is a practical guide to the power of prayer. This book teaches readers how to make prayer a meaningful part of daily life, offering methods for praying in various situations, from everyday routines to times of crisis. Murphy emphasizes that prayer can be a constant source of strength and guidance, not just a last resort in difficult times. This book serves as a manual for anyone looking to harness the positive effects of prayer in their life.</marc:subfield>
